189
00:10:01.403 --> 00:10:01.403


190
00:10:03.682 --> 00:10:06.234
Here, we're going to recreate
a retrieval pipeline

191
00:10:06.234 --> 00:10:08.467
with two different
types of retrievers, an

192
00:10:08.467 --> 00:10:10.382
SVM retriever and a TF-IDF retriever.


193
00:10:11.081 --> 00:10:13.678
If you recognize these terms from
traditional NLP or

194
00:10:13.678 --> 00:10:15.121
traditional machine learning, that's
great.

195
00:10:16.082 --> 00:10:18.657
If you don't, it's also fine. This is
