196
00:10:18.657 --> 00:10:20.159
some other techniques that
are out there.

197
00:10:20.598 --> 00:10:22.115
There are plenty more
besides these and I

198
00:10:22.115 --> 00:10:23.822
encourage you to go
check out some of them.

199
00:10:26.178 --> 00:10:28.421
We can run through
the usual pipeline of

200
00:10:28.421 --> 00:10:29.822
loading and splitting pretty
quickly.

201
00:10:32.078 --> 00:10:34.372
And then both of these
retrievers expose a from text

