00:10:44.587 --> 00:10:45.799
Now we can use the other retrievers.

207
00:10:46.538 --> 00:10:48.435
Let's pass in what did
they say about MATLAB

208
00:10:48.435 --> 00:10:50.121
to the SVM retriever
and we can look

